  ("Differentiate spring and neap tides.", "Spring tides occur at full and new moon with Sun-Earth-Moon aligned (large range); neap tides at quarter moons (small range)."),
  ("Why does Norway not freeze despite high latitude?", "The warm Gulf Stream flows towards it."),
